{"SiteSetting.default_locale is accessed inside FallbackLocaleList#[] but SiteSetting may not be available at initializer load time, causing potential errors or incorrect values": 0.15454576909542084, "The comment '# order: after 02-freedom_patches.rb' doesn't enforce initializer ordering - need to name the file with a number prefix or document in deployment notes": 0.5237748026847839, "I18n.ensure_loaded! is called in the initializer but may not be defined on I18n - the ensure_loaded! method is added to translate_accelerator which may not be the same as I18n.ensure_loaded!": 0.24211740493774414, "The ensure_loaded! method in translate_accelerator.rb may not be accessible via I18n.ensure_loaded! if it's defined on a separate TranslateAccelerator instance rather than patched onto I18n.backend": 0.10112255066633224, "FallbackLocaleList#ensure_loaded! could add per-request overhead if load operations are expensive - consider eager preloading commonly-used locales at boot": 0.060110192745923996, "Hardcoded :en as final fallback instead of using I18n.default_locale - should ensure SiteSetting.default_locale and I18n.default_locale are consistent": 0.11840898543596268, "Missing tests to verify fallback order is [user locale, site locale, en]": 0.48398756980895996, "Missing tests to verify fallback locales are preloaded and translations are available for server-side translation": 0.2183920294046402, "Missing tests to verify behavior when SiteSetting.default_locale is nil or not set": 0.2986927926540375, "Need to confirm no other places expect the config.i18n.fallbacks = true environment variable flag after removal": 0.18822070956230164}